{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Trek",
    "steam_appid": 3521650,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day the sky came falling down, ripping the world apart. The world used to be Humans and Creatures living in peace. But after the fall, many Creatures turned on the others. A Father who lost his family in this event by one of the Creatures, seeks revenge against the one behind it all. From then on, he sees all Creatures as enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along his path he comes across many people that would help him on his revenge quest. Though not many fighters remain.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521650/extras/880554280e5935d7bcbc8de92351549b.avif?t=1754018873\" data-has-big width=800 height=494 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding great weapons that would make him unstoppable against any who faces him.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521650/extras/6057b51a61af04e8d2496da076ca16e1.avif?t=1754018873\" data-has-big width=800 height=478 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though he would have to go through all the big leaders to get to the one behind it all.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521650/extras/e0185f2c563bddf3b138a6883b07fc69.avif?t=1754018873\" data-has-big width=800 height=662 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced fighting with slow flow and progression makes Trek.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game's story is not yet complete and there will be expansions coming to the game with many other small patches. A story that will keep building up till it is complete.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every expansion comes more bosses, more weapons, and many other exciting stuff.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day the sky came falling down, ripping the world apart. The world used to be Humans and Creatures living in peace. But after the fall, many Creatures turned on the others. A Father who lost his family in this event by one of the Creatures, seeks revenge against the one behind it all. From then on, he sees all Creatures as enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along his path he comes across many people that would help him on his revenge quest. Though not many fighters remain.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521650/extras/880554280e5935d7bcbc8de92351549b.avif?t=1754018873\" data-has-big width=800 height=494 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding great weapons that would make him unstoppable against any who faces him.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521650/extras/6057b51a61af04e8d2496da076ca16e1.avif?t=1754018873\" data-has-big width=800 height=478 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though he would have to go through all the big leaders to get to the one behind it all.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521650/extras/e0185f2c563bddf3b138a6883b07fc69.avif?t=1754018873\" data-has-big width=800 height=662 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced fighting with slow flow and progression makes Trek.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game's story is not yet complete and there will be expansions coming to the game with many other small patches. A story that will keep building up till it is complete.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every expansion comes more bosses, more weapons, and many other exciting stuff.\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "A fast-paced RPG fighting style combined with slow progression creates the unique experience of Trek. In this game you will be able to unlock weapons and items, defeat bosses, and progress through a story of revenge. A human who sees all creatures as enemies.",
